Package: armatos-cursus
Version: 2779.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: armatos-voice, apt, sudo
Recommends: armatos-damnatio, armatos-lex
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: cursus publicus — the imperial road for packages
 A thin wrapper around apt. "cursus" on its own collects tribute: it updates
 the APT system, Discord (through vesta-temple) and any Flatpak peregrina.
 Every change is preceded by a damnatio snapshot, so it can be undone.
